   "synopsis": "Maomao lived a peaceful life with her apothecary father. Until one day, she’s sold as a lowly servant to the emperor’s palace. But she wasn’t meant for a compliant life among royalty. So when imperial heirs fall ill, she decides to step in and find a cure! This catches the eye of Jinshi, a handsome palace official who promotes her. Now, she’s making a name for herself solving medical mysteries!\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)",
   "episodes": 24,
   "start": "2023-10-21",
   "source": "https://kitsu.io/anime/kusuriya-no-hitorigoto"
  },
